        "name": "珊瑚宮心海",
        "desc": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">真珠之智 · 珊瑚宮心海</span></p><p>未雨綢繆，臨危莫亂。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/25/84496276/b29a2e6be38663b3308b587eb20bc53c_7393277057814751210.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
